    "body": "Thanks for the suggestion! I'm suggesting `enhancement` since this is a clear, well-described feature request (new `gh pr share` subcommand with a defined syntax, rationale, and even a draft implementation linked), and `gh-pr` since it targets the `pr` command family. No duplicate issues were found in `cli/cli` after searching for related terms like \"share\", \"markdown format\", and \"clipboard\".\n\n> Generated by [Issue Triage (skills-driven)](https://github.com/cli/cli/actions/runs/37616058553) for #14618 \u00b7 copilot \u00b7 auto \u00b7 20.4 AIC \u00b7 \u2316 2.21 AIC \u00b7 \u229e 11K \u00b7 [\u25f7](https://github.com/search?q=repo%3Acli%2Fcli+%22gh-aw-workflow-call-id%3A+cli%2Fcli%2Fissue-triage%22&type=issues)\n\n<!-- gh-aw-agentic-workflow: Issue Triage (skills-driven), engine: copilot, model: auto, id: 37616058553, workflow_id: issue-triage, run: https://github.com/cli/cli/actions/runs/37616058553 -->\n<!-- gh-aw-workflow-call-id: cli/cli/issue-triage -->",
